# Ashenvale (21-22): a first, short visit to Ashenvale (Va'xug Firefure's ravine north of the
# Talondeep Path, Zoram'gar Outpost and the naga of the Zoram Strand), then Thunder Bluff and
# Orgrimmar for the Forsaken's errand and the class quests of level 20 (the troll priests'
# Shadowguard, the warlocks' Dogran and his succubus, the rogues' Venture Co. tower), for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/ashenvale_21_22.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites, race and class masks, drops and the
# places of mobs and objects from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games
# (Ashenvale, area 331; The Barrens; Thunder Bluff; Orgrimmar); RestedXP's and Zygor's routes as a
# check. Wowhead refused the requests (403), so its comments were not read: the research is partial.
# The quest list is section 6 of addon/guides/horde_1_40_allocation.md, plus A Void Path (98252),
# the follow-up of Never Coming Back (98251): no guide had it (the allocation left it out as a
# dungeon quest, but it is done on the road of Ashenvale, by Va'xug's ravine).
#
# Starts in Stonetalon Mountains, at the Talondeep Path (the tunnel in the north-east of Stonetalon
#   into Ashenvale): The Barrens & Stonetalon Mountain (15-21) should end there, after its last
#   quests in Stonetalon.
# Carried in (skipped by those who lack them), for The Barrens & Stonetalon Mountain (15-21) to take:
# - The Elder Crone (1063, Seereth Stonebreak in the west of the Barrens, after Goblin Invaders 1062),
#   handed in to Magatha in Thunder Bluff here.
# - Trouble in the Deeps (6562, Tsunaman at Sun Rock Retreat), handed in at Zoram'gar Outpost here.
# - for warlocks, Ken'zigla's Draught (1511, Ken'zigla at Malaka'jin, after News of Dogran 1510),
#   handed in to Grunt Logmar at Camp Taurajo here.
# Left to Hillsbrad Foothills (22-24):
# - Journey to Tarren Mill (1065, Apothecary Zamah in Thunder Bluff), handed in to Apothecary Lydon.
# - for Undead priests, Dark Sacrifice (5644, Miles Welsh in Thunder Bluff), handed in to
#   Aelthalyste in Undercity.
# Race-only class quests: Shadowguard (Troll priests) and Dark Sacrifice (Undead priests) are shown
#   only to those priests (the builder reads the race masks).
# The auction house: none of this guide's quest items is sold there, so there is no AH stop.
#
# The route: through the Talondeep Path into Ashenvale; Va'xug Firefure's ravine (the bears and
# stags, then his Eye of Kilrogg to the road); west past the Ruins of Stardust to Zoram'gar Outpost
# and the naga of the Zoram Strand; a flight to Thunder Bluff; warlocks fly to Camp Taurajo and walk
# to Dogran and the Crossroads; a flight to Orgrimmar for the class quests (rogues go out once more,
# to the Venture Co. tower in the north of the Barrens); the end at the wind rider tower of
# Orgrimmar, where Hillsbrad Foothills (22-24) starts.

guide Ashenvale (21-22)
faction horde
levels 21 22
carry 264 1063 1511 1536 3301 6562 93739
leave 264 1065 1536 3301 5644
next Hillsbrad Foothills (22-24)

# Va'xug Firefure's ravine --------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Ashenvale
accept 98251
tip From Stonetalon Mountains, walk the Talondeep Path, the long tunnel in the north-east of Stonetalon, into Ashenvale. Va'xug Firefure, a Horde warlock, is stuck in the ravine a short way north of where it comes out.
do 98251
tip The Ashenvale Bears and Shadowhorn Stags (level 21-23) roam the woods all around the ravine and south to the mouth of the tunnel. Kills count for both of you: pull one at a time, the stags hit hard for your level.
turnin 98251
accept 98252
tip Both of you take it, then set off together: each gets an Eye of Kilrogg to lead.
do 98252 at 44.4,56.5 "Lead the Eye of Kilrogg out of the ravine to the main Ashenvale road"
tip The eye follows you and Va'xug holds it for four minutes only: walk straight out of the ravine, north, to the nearest stretch of the main road, without stopping to fight: the eye counts as soon as it reaches the road. Too late? Go back to Va'xug and take the quest again.
turnin 98252
tip Talk to your Eye of Kilrogg on the road to hand it in.

# Zoram'gar Outpost and the Zoram Strand ------------------------------------------------------------

goto "Go west past the Ruins of Stardust and along the western hills to Zoram'gar Outpost, on the Zoram Strand" at 12.2,33.8 r 30
tip Keep well south and west of Astranaar, the night elf town on the lake in the middle of the zone: its Sentinels are level 40. Go round the Ruins of Stardust, then north-west through the hills to the coast.
fpath 11901
turnin 6562
tip Je'neu Sancrea is inside the big hut of the outpost. Leave The Essence of Aku'Mai he offers next: it is for Blackfathom Deeps, a dungeon.
accept 6442
tip Marukai is inside the big hut of the outpost. Leave the other quests of the outpost (Karang's furbolgs, Mitsuwa's troll charms, Muglash's escort): Ashenvale (26-28) does them.
do 6442 at 10.3,27.5
tip The Wrathtail naga line the shore north of the outpost, up to the ruins of Zoram at the northern end of the strand. Every one of them drops a head. The Sea Witches and Sorceresses are casters: kill them first, and pull the camps apart before they gang up on you.
turnin 6442

# Thunder Bluff ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Thunder Bluff, Mulgore" npc 11901
tip The flight goes by the Crossroads. Your hearthstone is set in Thunder Bluff? Use it instead.
map Thunder Bluff
turnin 1063
accept 1064
tip Magatha Grimtotem is inside her tent on the Elder Rise.
train 3033
tip Druids only: the druid trainers are in the Hall of Elders on the Elder Rise.
turnin 1064
accept 1065
tip Apothecary Zamah is in the Pools of Vision, the cave under the Spirit Rise. Keep Zamah's Note: Hillsbrad Foothills (22-24) takes it to Tarren Mill.
accept 5642
tip Troll priests only: Miles Welsh, in the Pools of Vision, sends you to Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar.
accept 5644
tip Undead priests only: keep it, Hillsbrad Foothills (22-24) hands it in at Undercity.
fly "Orgrimmar, Durotar" npc 2995 only warrior paladin hunter rogue priest shaman mage druid
fly "Camp Taurajo, The Barrens" npc 2995 only warlock
tip Warlocks only: Dogran's quests take you through the Barrens before Orgrimmar.

# Warlocks: Camp Taurajo, Dogran and the Crossroads ------------------------------------------------------

map The Barrens
turnin 1511
accept 1515
tip Warlocks only: Grunt Logmar is at Camp Taurajo, by the flight master.
turnin 1515
accept 1512
tip Dogran is held in one of a pair of huts in a Bristleback quilboar camp, north of Camp Taurajo. Its hunters and geomancers are level 17-20, and Swinegart Spearhide, a level 22 rare elite, can walk there: clear it together, one group at a time.
fly "Orgrimmar, Durotar" npc 3615 only warlock
tip Walk north-east along the road to the Crossroads to take the flight.

# Orgrimmar -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Orgrimmar
turnin 5642
tip Troll priests only: Ur'kyo is with the priest trainers in the Valley of Spirits.
turnin 1512
accept 1513
tip Warlocks only: Gan'rul Bloodeye is in the Cleft of Shadow.
do 1513 at 49.4,50.0 mobs 5677 icon kill "Use Dogran's Pendant on the summoning circle in Neeru's tent and defeat the Summoned Succubus"
tip The circle is in Neeru Fireblade's tent, a few steps from Gan'rul. Heal up and have your pet out before you call her; your partner can help you beat her.
turnin 1513
accept 2460
do 2460 icon talk "Watch Shenthul salute you, then /salute him back"
tip Rogues only: Shenthul is in the Cleft of Shadow. Target him and type /salute once he has saluted you.
turnin 2460
accept 2458
tip Keep the Flare Gun: you need it at the Venture Co. tower.
bind 6929 only rogue
tip Rogues only: set your hearthstone here, at the inn of the Valley of Strength. It brings you back from the tower.

# Rogues: the Venture Co. tower ------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Crossroads, The Barrens" npc 3310 only rogue
map The Barrens
turnin 2458
tip Run north from the Crossroads along the road to Mor'shan Rampart; the tower stands east of the road, north of the Sludge Fen. In sight of it, fire the Flare Gun twice, then walk up to Taskmaster Fizzule and /salute him.
accept 2478
do 2478.5 "Pick Foreman Silixiz's pocket for Silixiz's Tower Key"
tip Foreman Silixiz is at the foot of the tower: pick his pocket in stealth for the key, without fighting him.
do 2478.1
do 2478.3
do 2478.2
tip Inside the tower: the Mutated Drones are on the ground floor, the Patrollers and Lookouts higher up. The poison has weakened them all: open each fight from stealth. The quest is an elite one: your partner can fight with you.
do 2478.4
tip Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix waits at the top of the tower. He is an elite: rest first and fight him together.
do 2478.6 at 54.8,5.6 icon get "Pick the lock of Gallywix's Lockbox and take the Cache of Zanzil's Altered Mixture"
tip The lockbox sits by Gallywix at the top of the tower: use Pick Lock on it.
hearth npc 6929 only rogue
tip Hearthstone not ready? Walk back to the Crossroads and fly to Orgrimmar.
map Orgrimmar
turnin 2478
tip Back to Shenthul in the Cleft of Shadow. Leave Hinott's Assistance he offers next: Hillsbrad Foothills (22-24) takes it.

# The end: the wind rider tower ---------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 93739
tip Windshaper Skyborne: back to Thrall in Grommash Hold with Exploring the Horde.
goto "Go to the wind rider tower in the Valley of Strength, for the next guide" at 45.1,63.9 r 15
